{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090415296c74f394226e4074","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Design Approach for Dra. Zulene Ferreira - Harmonização Orofacial\n\n**Analyzing the context:**\n- **Purpose**: Professional website for Dr. Zulene Ferreira specializing in orofacial harmonization in Ribeirão Preto\n- **Clinic name**: \"Implantes\" - focusing on harmonização facial e estética avançada\n- **Previous patterns learned**: 45+ unique palettes already used (Moonstone Noir, Rose Gold & Velvet, Cinnamon & Pearl Silk, Platinum & Rose Gold, Obsidian & Champagne Quartz, etc.)\n\n**Design Direction Choice:**\n\nI'll create a **\"Jade Noir & Golden Pearl\"** aesthetic - a completely new direction inspired by:\n- **Jade stones** - representing harmony, balance, and renewal (perfect for facial harmonization)\n- **Golden Pearl** - luxurious, natural beauty enhancement\n- **Deep Noir backgrounds** - sophisticated and premium feel\n\n**Why this direction:**\n1. Jade represents harmony, balance, and natural beauty - perfectly aligned with orofacial harmonization\n2. The jade-green tones are completely different from all 45+ previous palettes\n3. Golden Pearl adds warmth and luxury without being predictable\n4. This creates an elegant, natural, sophisticated aesthetic\n\n**Typography Choice:**\n- **Display**: **Cormorant Garamond** - elegant serif with luxurious qualities (new to this project)\n- **Body**: **Instrument Sans** - refined geometric sans-serif with excellent readability\n\n**Color Palette:**\n- Jade Green: `#2D6A5A` (primary), `#3D8A7A` (light), `#1D4A3A` (dark)\n- Golden Pearl: `#D4C4A8` (primary), `#E8DCC8` (light), `#B8A888` (dark)\n- Noir Deep: `#0A0A0F` (background), `#12121A` (secondary)\n- Ivory Mist: `#F0F0E8` (light accent)\n\nLet me create the directory and start building:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd696b02-9b16-432b-bb17-36f53a4957ad","uuid":"aadd57df-3a79-4a66-ab2a-60d5fd3fc31d"}
