typography - it provides elegant serif luxury with qualities that make it unique from all previous font choices (Playfair Display, Bodoni Moda, Libre Baskerville, EB Garamond, etc.)","+- **Gotcha**: Instrument Sans is a refined geometric sans-serif that provides excellent readability with contemporary sophistication - the first use of this font in the project","+- **Gotcha**: The jade-green-golden-pearl aesthetic is particularly appropriate for facial harmonization clinics as jade symbolizes harmony, balance, and renewal in many cultures - creating meaningful brand resonance","+- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance","+- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile","+","+---"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
